<%- include('dash-header') %><div class="dashboard-heading"><div><p class="overline">ONE PLAN. EVERY VOICE.</p><h1>Living projects.</h1><p class="heading-description">Keep the goal, the decisions, and the next step together. See what changed and where it came from.</p></div><a class="dash-button lime" href="<%= brainLink('/dashboard/projects/new') %>">+ Start a project</a></div><% if(!projects.length) { %><section class="dash-panel project-welcome"><div><p class="overline">START WITH SOMETHING REAL</p><h2>A plan that survives<br>the change of voice.</h2><p>Tell Maya what matters. Let Charlie take the next step. Brain keeps the shared plan, its sources, and the decisions that still need you.</p><a class="dash-button lime" href="<%= brainLink('/dashboard/projects/new') %>">Name your first project →</a></div><ol><li><strong>Set the goal</strong><span>A trip, a launch, a decision, or something you’re building.</span></li><li><strong>Build the record</strong><span>Constraints, decisions, open questions, and work in progress.</span></li><li><strong>Review what changed</strong><span>A changed constraint flags the work that depends on it.</span></li></ol></section><% } else { %><div class="project-grid"><% projects.forEach(project=>{ %><a class="dash-panel project-card" href="<%= brainLink('/dashboard/projects/'+project.id) %>"><div class="memory-card-top"><span class="state-pill"><%= project.status %></span><span>↗</span></div><h2><%= project.title %></h2><p><%= project.goal||project.summary||'A shared plan, ready for the next step.' %></p><div class="project-card-counts"><% Object.entries(project.item_counts||{}).forEach(([type,count])=>{ %><span><strong><%= count %></strong> <%= type %></span><% }) %></div><% if(project.needs_review_count) { %><p class="review-notice"><%= project.needs_review_count %> items need your review</p><% } %><div class="memory-card-meta"><strong>Version <%= project.version %></strong><time><%= relativeTime(project.updated_at) %></time></div></a><% }) %></div><% } %><%- include('dash-footer') %>